<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Fees and Tax Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Comprehensive tax and fee handling ensuring regulatory compliance, accurate 
            calculation, and complete audit trails for all statutory obligations.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Value Added Tax</h2>
        <p>
            VAT configuration supports multiple tax rates including standard, reduced, and zero-rated 
            categories with exempt transaction handling. Tax codes apply automatically based on product 
            classification and customer registration status, ensuring correct treatment across diverse 
            transaction types.
        </p>
        <p>
            Input and output tax tracking maintains running balances of VAT recoverable and payable, 
            with return preparation aggregating transactions by period for regulatory filing. Reverse 
            charge mechanisms handle imported services requiring customer-side tax recognition.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Withholding Tax</h2>
        <p>
            Withholding tax computation applies statutory rates to supplier payments, generating 
            tax certificates and regulatory returns. Net payment calculation ensures suppliers 
            receive correct after-tax amounts while the organization maintains compliance with 
            deduction and remittance requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
            Exemption certificate handling validates non-withholding status for qualifying suppliers, 
            with expiration tracking to prevent inadvertent withholding lapses. Historical withholding 
            summaries support supplier tax credit claims and organizational audit requirements.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Statutory Deductions</h2>
        <p>
            Payroll-related statutory deductions compute automatically based on current regulatory 
            rates and employee-specific parameters. Social security, health insurance, and other 
            mandated contributions generate with complete audit trails for remittance and reconciliation.
        </p>
        <p>
            Return preparation produces regulatory filings in required formats, with electronic 
            submission support where available. Payment scheduling ensures timely remittance avoiding 
            penalty exposure.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Audit and Compliance</h2>
        <p>
            Complete transaction-level tax detail supports audit inquiry and regulatory inspection. 
            Tax account reconciliation ensures general ledger balances agree with transaction 
            registers, identifying discrepancies requiring investigation.
        </p>
        <p>
            Historical rate tracking documents tax rates effective during prior periods, 
            supporting amendment filings and audit defense for historical transactions.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

